          "en": "Every person who employs a Ship Crew without meeting the qualification and competency requirements as referred to in Article 135, and thereby causes victims or loss of property, is punishable with imprisonment for a maximum of 2 (two) years and a fine of at most Rp300,000,000.00 (three hundred million rupiah).\n\n64 The provision of Article 313 is amended to read as follows:"
